        },
        {
          "text": "Wac pa Rwoth m'obino ri Hoseya wod Ber i hongo pa Uziya, Yotham, Ahaz kodi Hezekia kerin ma Yuda, kodi i hongo pa kere ma Isiraili, Yerobowam wod Yowas.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.1",
