        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goma ogamo iye kendo to nywolo nyare. Rwoth owaco ri Hoseya ni, “Cwoki nyinge ni Loruhama;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1:6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Loruhama",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Dwoŋ mere ni K'omaki gine wor",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kole Ak'omaki wor gi ot pa Isiraili kosa ak'ocwaki jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To alamako wor gi ot pa Yuda, aka alabotho jo gi an Rwoth Were pajo; ak'obothi jo g'atum abor, kosa abor, kosa lweny, kosa gi kayinin, kosa gi cwo ma jogweyo kayinin.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
